To build the decision tree run:
python -m education_framework.scripts.build_decision_tree --csv education_framework/data/algebra_2005_2006_train.txt --out education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --n_topics 7 --max_depth 7 --min_leaf 50 --ema_alpha 0.2 --seed 0

To run the model in single agent mode:
python -m education_framework.main --bundle education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --episodes 2000 --max_steps 300 --arch flat --ll_mode single --share_mode off

To run multi agent without experience sharing:
python -m education_framework.main --bundle education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --episodes 2000 --max_steps 300 --share_mode off

To run multi agent with cfk experience sharing:
python -m education_framework.main --bundle education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --episodes 2000 --max_steps 300 --experience_sharing

To run multi agent with mutual experience sharing:
python -m education_framework.main --bundle education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --episodes 2000 --max_steps 300 --experience_sharing --share_mode mutual

To run multi agent with tutee without experience sharing:
python -m education_framework.main --bundle education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --episodes 2000 --max_steps 300 --share_mode off --use_tutee

To run multi agent with tutee with experience sharing:
python -m education_framework.main --bundle education_framework/data/kdd_bundle.joblib --episodes 2000 --max_steps 300 --experience_sharing --use_tutee

Seeds:
0, 23, 48